 "description": "Fetch tidy rows from any OECD dataflow. flow_ref examples: \"OECD.SDD.NAD,DSD_NAMAIN1@DF_QNA_EXPENDITURE_GROWTH,1.0\". The key string is a dot-separated dimension filter (e.g., \"USA.....Q\" \u2014 leave empty to fetch everything). Use start/end periods like \"2020-Q1\" or \"2020\". Returns labeled rows; OECD enforces a result-size limit and may truncate broad queries \u2014 narrow with key dimensions or shorter time ranges.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
   {
    "end_period": "2023-Q4",
    "flow_ref": "OECD.SDD.NAD,DSD_NAMAIN1@DF_QNA_EXPENDITURE_GROWTH,1.0",
    "key": "USA.....Q",
    "start_period": "2020-Q1"
   },
   {
